flickos-style-seven (1.2) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Homepage is github.com/Flick-OS/flickos.
  * Seven's own layout (ricing ADR-013, amended): one see-through panel
    at the bottom with a round glossy start button, large window icons
    in glass boxes, the status, a two-line clock and a wider Show
    Desktop strip. Software's Use sets the style and the layout
    together.
  * Homepage is flickos.org, and debian/copyright's Source the public
    repository.

 -- Jon <dvbondoy@gmail.com>  Fri, 16 Oct 2026 12:47:25 +0800

